+# PyErrorFix guard template for Supremeai-bd/supremeai-core
+# Source-of-truth change for .github/workflows/ci.yml (job: autofix).
+# Apply: replace the "Upload SARIF to GitHub code scanning" step with the step below.
+# Rationale: #1445 — nightly PyErrorFix run failed because upload-sarif fails when
+# code scanning is not enabled; reporting must not fail the auto-fixer.
+
+      - name: Upload SARIF to GitHub code scanning
+        if: always()
+        continue-on-error: true
+        uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3
+        with:
+          sarif_file: pyerrorfix-results.sarif
+          category: pyerrorfix
+
+# Recommended companion (operator action, zero code):
+#   Settings -> Code security -> Code scanning tools -> Default setup
+#   so the upload has a real destination and the guard stays a safety net only.
